"终对象"}, {"source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在陈述下一个引理之前，先指出由纤维化（fibred）于群胚（groupoids）的范畴（categories）构成的<MATH_0001>-范畴（category）是<MATH_0002>-范畴（category），因此我们知道说它具有终对象（final object）是什么意思（见定义<REF_0001>）。它确实具有终对象（final object），即<MATH_0003>。于是，我们定义<TEXTITOPEN_0001><MATH_0004>-积（products）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对<MATH_0005>上纤维化（fibred）于群胚（groupoids）的范畴（categories）而言，它们就是<MATH_0006>-纤维积（fibre products）\n<MATH_0007>\n有了这个定义，下面的引理就有意义了。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:76ab284a1866eafe1bc07c546b904eaa38603f19e1812cd7520146d0430943ce", "unit_id": "tag:02Y4:prose-0002", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "两个带受保护阶数限定的范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "高阶范畴的对象；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "对象的纤维化性质；待决。", "source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"context": "纤维化的群胚条件；待决。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "高阶范畴的终对象；待决。", "source_term": "final object", "target_term": "终对象"}, {"context": "带受保护阶数限定的积；待决。", "source_term": "products", "target_term": "积"}, {"context": "定义中使用的高阶纤维积；待决。", "source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}]}
